---
// Quiz figure for go-errors-defer-panic set 02: the deferred calls registered by the program, in the order the defer lines run.
// It shows what each entry stores; it does not show the order they run or the printed output.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq05dl">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 290" role="img" aria-label="Four deferred calls in the order their defer lines were reached, each with what it stores, and the variable x with its value over time.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq05dl-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Defer lines, in the order they were reached</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Các dòng defer, theo thứ tự chương trình đi qua</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="36" width="330" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq05dl-cell" />
    <text x="34" y="61" class="qfig-gq05dl-n">1</text>
    <text x="60" y="61" class="qfig-gq05dl-m">Println("defer", i)</text>
    <text x="206" y="61" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stores i = 1</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lưu i = 1</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="82" width="330" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq05dl-cell" />
    <text x="34" y="107" class="qfig-gq05dl-n">2</text>
    <text x="60" y="107" class="qfig-gq05dl-m">Println("defer", i)</text>
    <text x="206" y="107" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stores i = 2</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lưu i = 2</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="128" width="330" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq05dl-cell" />
    <text x="34" y="153" class="qfig-gq05dl-n">3</text>
    <text x="60" y="153" class="qfig-gq05dl-m">Println("defer", i)</text>
    <text x="206" y="153" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stores i = 3</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lưu i = 3</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="174" width="330" height="40" rx="6" class="qfig-gq05dl-end" />
    <text x="34" y="199" class="qfig-gq05dl-n">4</text>
    <text x="60" y="199" class="qfig-gq05dl-m">func() &#123; ... x ... &#125;</text>
    <text x="206" y="199" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>stores the function</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>lưu hàm</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="380" y="52" class="qfig-gq05dl-t">x</text>
    <rect x="380" y="62" width="180" height="152" rx="8" class="qfig-gq05dl-card" />
    <text x="394" y="88" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>x := 10</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>x := 10</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="394" y="114" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>defer line 4 reached</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>đi qua dòng defer 4</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="394" y="140" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">x = 20</text>
    <text x="394" y="166" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Println("end", x)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Println("end", x)</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="394" y="192" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>closing brace of main</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>dấu đóng của main</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="20" y="232" width="540" height="40" rx="8" class="qfig-gq05dl-card" />
    <text x="36" y="257" class="qfig-gq05dl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>Time runs downwards in both columns.</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Thời gian chạy từ trên xuống ở cả hai cột.</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq05dl { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq05dl svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq05dl text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq05dl .qfig-gq05dl-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq05dl .qfig-gq05dl-t { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq05dl .qfig-gq05dl-n { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq05dl .qfig-gq05dl-m { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq05dl .qfig-gq05dl-b { fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq05dl-cell { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq05dl-end { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 2; }
  .qfig-gq05dl-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
</style>
